  "title": "Barnegat Light Fights Boat Fire",
  "description": "Members of Coast Guard Station Barnegat Light respond to a fire aboard a 20-foot recreational boat near Harvey Cedars, New Jersey on Aug. 10th, 2019.\r\n\r\nTwo boaters aboard were rescued by a commercial towing vessel, while the Coast Guard rescue crew used a P6 pump and hose to reduce the fire and prevent property damage as the flaming vessel drifted toward shore. Coast Guard crews reduced it to 95% extinguished and local police brought it to shore for a local fire department to take control of.\r\n\r\nCoast Guard video courtesy of Coast Guard Station Barnegat Light, New Jersey",
